# @name login

### Registrere ny bruker
POST http://localhost:3030/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fornavn": "Test",
  "etternavn": "Testesen",
  "epost": "test@xyz.com",
  "passord": "hemmelig123",
  "adresse": "Testveien 1",
  "postnr": "3800"
}

### Logg inn
POST http://localhost:3030/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "epost": "test@xyz.com",
  "passord": "hemmelig123"
}

### Sjekk innloggingsstatus
GET http://localhost:3030/user

### Registrere ordre (krever innlogging). Kunden hentes fra sesjonen, ikke fra body.
POST http://localhost:3030/ordrer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kurv": [
    {
      "vnr": "10820",
      "antall": 2,
      "pris": 99.5
    },
    {
      "vnr": "10830",
      "antall": 1,
      "pris": 122.0
    }
  ]
}

### Logg ut
POST http://localhost:3030/logout

### Test uten innlogging (skal gi 401)
POST http://localhost:3030/ordrer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kurv": []
}

### Hent alle varer
GET http://localhost:3030/varer

### Hent én vare
GET http://localhost:3030/varer/10820

### Logg inn igjen
POST http://localhost:3030/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "epost": "test@xyz.com",
  "passord": "hemmelig123"
}

### Hent egne kundeopplysninger (200, uten passord)
GET http://localhost:3030/kunder/test@xyz.com

### Hent en annen kunde (403 - innlogget, men ikke tilgang)
GET http://localhost:3030/kunder/paaa@abc.no
